# Cloudflare static-assets redirects (copied verbatim into public/ by Hugo).
#
# Desktop auto-update endpoint (docs/63). This URL is compiled into every
# installed copy of Avalanche Desktop, so it must keep working for as long as
# old copies run: change where it points, never remove it. It points at the
# newest *published* GitHub Release; drafts and prereleases are skipped, so
# publishing a draft is what ships an update. Trust comes from the update
# signature the app verifies, not from this host.
/desktop/update/latest.json https://github.com/lincolnq/avalanche/releases/latest/download/latest.json 302
